    <string name="nw141_explanation_c6f15710c6">This removes history entries only. Liked songs, playlists and downloaded music stay saved.</string>
    <string name="nw141_explanation_faafd289db">Creator names come from liked songs, playlists and history; they are not verified artist profiles.</string>
    <string name="nw141_explanation_ced7683e4b">Only your listening history is cleared. Liked songs, playlists and offline audio stay saved.</string>
    <string name="nw141_explanation_acc4b006d8">Backups contain metadata, never offline audio or passwords. Google consent is optional. Manual compare is not live device sync. Automatic backup may run later than scheduled.</string>
    <string name="nw141_explanation_664b2913b4">Room and DataStore are optional read-only mirrors. Your existing saved library stays in use.</string>
    <string name="nw141_explanation_2de3312c31">Cloud recovery requires a Google-authorized, validated snapshot and always asks before replacing local collections.</string>
    <string name="nw141_explanation_453e36e6df">This backup contains library metadata and the options you choose. Audio files are not included. Every restore starts with a review.</string>
    <string name="nw141_explanation_6053dac6e7">If the error repeats, compare this APK\'s package and SHA-1 with the Android OAuth client. Check Drive API, Google Play services and OAuth test users.</string>
    <string name="nw141_explanation_0ed9b1899a">No compatible presets reported. You can still test manual bands if the active session supports them.</string>
    <string name="nw141_explanation_d7580987cf">Gapless is preferred when crossfade is off. Crossfade uses verified local tracks only; it pauses for Shuffle, Repeat One or non-1× speed. Streaming sources are not reprocessed.</string>
    <string name="nw141_explanation_f1c85f0e65">Optional 12-second PCM sample. Attenuates louder local tracks only; not ReplayGain or streaming normalization.</string>
